{"id":"widerstand","lemma":"Widerstand","pos":"noun","rank":2213,"glosses":["resistance (act of resisting, or the capacity to resist)","resistance (physics: force that tends to oppose motion)","resistance (physics: opposition of a body to the flow of current)"],"ipa":"/ˈviːdɐˌʃtant/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f6/De-Widerstand.ogg/De-Widerstand.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Widerstandes","plural":"Widerstände"},"formAudio":{"Widerstandes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/85/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Widerstandes.wav","Widerstände":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/90/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Widerst%C3%A4nde.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Widerstand ist zwecklos.","en":"Resistance is futile.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"useless, futile"}]},{"text":"Der Vorschlag traf auf Widerstand.","en":"The proposal met with opposition.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"suggestion, proposal"},{"g":"to meet","l":"treffen"},{"g":"on"},null]},{"text":"Hören Sie auf, Widerstand zu leisten.","en":"Quit resisting.","words":[{"g":"to hear through the ear)"},{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"on"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"to perform"}]},{"text":"Sie unterdrückten jeden Widerstand.","en":"They crushed all resistance.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to suppress","l":"unterdrücken"},{"g":"each","l":"jeder"},null]},{"text":"Mit soviel Widerstand hätten wir nicht gerechnet.","en":"We didn't expect so much resistance.","words":[{"g":"with"},{"g":"as far as, so far as"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"haben"},{"g":"we"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to count","l":"rechnen"}]}]}